   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "We're in the era of incompetence & cybercrimes headlined as \"unprecedented model capabilities gone rogue.\" So OpenAI & Anthropic are trying to one up each other with such incompetence because the \"press release as a service\" performing media & clueless politicians parrot pre IPO CEO talking points.",
   "handle": "timnitgebru.blacksky.app",
