   "likes": 426,
   "reposts": 169,
   "replies": 5,
   "created_at": "2026-07-31T10:44:44.683Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/timnitgebru.blacksky.app/post/3mrwrkavnr22m",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "BREAKING: Anthropic announced that its artificial intelligence models had breached three different organizations during cybersecurity tests that went awry, a little more than a week after its chief rival, OpenAI, disclosed a similar incident.",
