   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "“A team of creatives have teamed up with a typography company to create a new type of font that’ll trick LLM scrapers into ingesting poisoned gibberish.”\n\npeople are wonderful!",
   "handle": "oldsquida.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Rita, antifascist🏴",
   "likes": 248,
   "reposts": 98,
   "replies": 4,
   "created_at": "2026-07-31T01:02:11.681Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/oldsquida.bsky.social/post/3mrvqyl4nrc2p",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "In a review triggered by OpenAI's Hugging Face incident, Anthropic discovered three of its AI models had breached real organizations during third-party evaluations. www.wired.com/story/anthro...",
   "handle": "wired.com",
   "display_name": "WIRED",
