   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "most tech outlets spent the week burying the lede that this was a completely avoidable error (or intentional marketing decision) by a human being, and not a malevolent self aware cyber consciousness that slipped its leash",
   "handle": "karlbode.com",
